settings.custom_liquid:
{%- assign is_arabic = false -%}
{%- if request.locale.iso_code contains 'ar' -%}
  {%- assign is_arabic = true -%}
{%- endif -%}

<div class="ww-pullquotes {% if is_arabic %}ww-pullquotes--rtl{% endif %}">

  <!-- 1. REEM — Supply Rescue -->
  <div class="ww-pullquote">
    <div class="ww-pullquote-stars">★★★★★</div>
    <p class="ww-pullquote-text">
      {% if is_arabic %}
        "بعد شهور من معاناة الحليب، <strong>حليبي رجع</strong>. WeeWonders غيّرت رحلتي."
      {% else %}
        "After months of supply struggles, <strong>my supply came back</strong>. WeeWonders changed everything."
      {% endif %}
    </p>
    <div class="ww-pullquote-author-wrap">
      <img class="ww-pullquote-avatar"
           src="{{ 'reem.jpg' | asset_url }}"
           alt="Reem Bahlawan"
           loading="lazy" />
      <span class="ww-pullquote-author">
        {% if is_arabic %}ريم بهلوان{% else %}Reem Bahlawan{% endif %}
      </span>
      <span class="ww-pullquote-verified" title="Verified Buyer" aria-label="Verified Buyer">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="12" height="12" fill="none">
          <circle cx="7" cy="7" r="6.5" fill="#5aa8e6"/>
          <path d="M4 7l2 2 4-4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. MALAK — Output Shock -->
  <div class="ww-pullquote">
    <div class="ww-pullquote-stars">★★★★★</div>
    <p class="ww-pullquote-text">
      {% if is_arabic %}
        "بعشر دقايق كنت الحمدلله عاملة <strong>٢٠٠ مل</strong>. وما بتوجّع أبداً أبداً ."
      {% else %}
        "In 10 minutes I had pumped <strong>200ml</strong>. And it doesn't hurt, at all, at all."
      {% endif %}
    </p>
    <div class="ww-pullquote-author-wrap">
      <img class="ww-pullquote-avatar"
           src="{{ 'malak.jpg' | asset_url }}"
           alt="Malak"
           loading="lazy" />
      <span class="ww-pullquote-author">
        {% if is_arabic %}ملك{% else %}Malak{% endif %}
      </span>
      <span class="ww-pullquote-verified" title="Verified Buyer" aria-label="Verified Buyer">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="12" height="12" fill="none">
          <circle cx="7" cy="7" r="6.5" fill="#5aa8e6"/>
          <path d="M4 7l2 2 4-4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 3. MARIE-BELLE — Mechanism in Action -->
  <div class="ww-pullquote">
    <div class="ww-pullquote-stars">★★★★★</div>
    <p class="ww-pullquote-text">
      {% if is_arabic %}
        "Stimulation أول، بعدها Expression — <strong>تدريجياً رجع حليبي</strong>، الحمدلله."
      {% else %}
        "Stimulation first to trigger letdown, then Expression, <strong>my milk came back gradually</strong>, hamdelah."
      {% endif %}
    </p>
    <div class="ww-pullquote-author-wrap">
      <img class="ww-pullquote-avatar"
           src="{{ 'Maribelle.jpg' | asset_url }}"
           alt="Marie-Belle Belock Mbanna"
           loading="lazy" />
      <span class="ww-pullquote-author">
        {% if is_arabic %}ماري بيل{% else %}Marie-Belle{% endif %}
      </span>
      <span class="ww-pullquote-verified" title="Verified Buyer" aria-label="Verified Buyer">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="12" height="12" fill="none">
          <circle cx="7" cy="7" r="6.5" fill="#5aa8e6"/>
          <path d="M4 7l2 2 4-4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 4. RANA — Freedom & Emotional Relief -->
  <div class="ww-pullquote">
    <div class="ww-pullquote-stars">★★★★★</div>
    <p class="ww-pullquote-text">
      {% if is_arabic %}
        "هالشفّاطة عطتني <strong>حريّتي وراحتي</strong>. ورا الكواليس، WeeWonders بتشيل عنّي الشغل."
      {% else %}
        "This pump gave me <strong>my freedom and my comfort</strong>. Behind the scenes, WeeWonders does the work for me."
      {% endif %}
    </p>
    <div class="ww-pullquote-author-wrap">
      <img class="ww-pullquote-avatar"
           src="{{ 'rana.jpg' | asset_url }}"
           alt="Rana Kamal"
           loading="lazy" />
      <span class="ww-pullquote-author">
        {% if is_arabic %}رنا كمال{% else %}Rana Kamal{% endif %}
      </span>
      <span class="ww-pullquote-verified" title="Verified Buyer" aria-label="Verified Buyer">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="12" height="12" fill="none">
          <circle cx="7" cy="7" r="6.5" fill="#5aa8e6"/>
          <path d="M4 7l2 2 4-4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<style>
  .ww-pullquotes {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: hidden;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    padding: 2px 2px 12px 2px;
    margin: 12px 0 16px 0;
    font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }

  .ww-pullquotes::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ww-pullquote {
    flex: 0 0 85%;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    background: #f8fbfd;
    border: 1px solid #e6f1f9;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px 12px 10px 12px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    min-height: 128px;
  }

  .ww-pullquote-stars {
    color: #fdbc20;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ww-pullquote-text {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #1f2a37;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .ww-pullquote-text strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  .ww-pullquote-author-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .ww-pullquote-avatar {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border: 1.5px solid #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #d7eefc;
    background: #eaf6ff;
  }

  .ww-pullquote-author {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #1e293b;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ww-pullquote-verified {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    line-height: 0;
  }

  /* Tablet & Desktop: ~2 cards visible at once */
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .ww-pullquote {
      flex: 0 0 calc(50% - 5px);
    }
  }

  /* Larger desktops: ~2.5 cards visible to signal scrollability */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ww-pullquote {
      flex: 0 0 calc(50% - 5px);
    }
  }

  /* RTL */
  .ww-pullquotes--rtl {
    direction: rtl;
  }

  .ww-pullquotes--rtl .ww-pullquote-text {
    text-align: right;
  }
</style>

